    "message": "Split the former LLM outcome tests by module and scope\n\nThe Runs that surface outcomes stay in tests/integration. The outcome\nsummary and the fallback warning of a text parse go to\ntests/unit/llm/test_outcomes.py, the stored tape joins\ntests/unit/llm/test_accounting.py, the saved-reply reuse of a preview\njoins tests/unit/web/test_workspace.py, and the CLI runs become\ntests/e2e/test_cli_run.py. The 30-person benchmark Scenario they share\nbecomes the small_benchmark_scenario fixture.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
